      {
        "id": 163658,
        "name": "armadagon",
        "username": "armadagon",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/armadagon/{size}/2379_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-01T18:21:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metaphysician\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/edb3f5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metaphysician:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Something to consider about suggestions:&nbsp; sometimes a suggestion isn't.&nbsp; Its actually a user clicking on their screen to advance through animations.&nbsp; I know that I end up accidentally clicking on something about half the time because of that.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I've done that more than a few times I care to admit to.</p>",
