        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-01T19:54:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"JimmyTheCannon\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/cdc98d/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> JimmyTheCannon:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Matchstickman wrote:</b><br><blockquote>I hate push to talk, because it is almost always push-and-hold to talk, and I am doing other things that require hands while talking.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;\n<p>While playing Sentinels?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yep.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"JimmyTheCannon\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/cdc98d/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> JimmyTheCannon:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It's completely mouse-driven.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Nope.</p>\n<p>I use the keyboard shortcuts a lot. And Alt Tabbing to do something else while it's not my turn and/or I think I know what is about to go down.</p>",
